{"suttaId":"tha-ap518","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3287,3313],"vripara":"28"},"segments":{"tha-ap518:0.3":"Ajjunapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap518:1.1":"“Candabhāgānadītīre, ahosiṃ kinnaro tadā;","tha-ap518:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, sayambhuṃ aparājitaṃ.","tha-ap518:2.1":"“Pasannacitto sumano, vedajāto katañjalī;","tha-ap518:2.3":"Gahetvā ajjunaṃ pupphaṃ, sayambhuṃ abhipūjayiṃ.","tha-ap518:3.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap518:3.3":"Jahitvā kinnaraṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap518:4.1":"“Chattiṃsakkhattuṃ devindo, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap518:4.3":"Dasakkhattuṃ cakkavattī, mahārajjamakārayiṃ.","tha-ap518:5.1":"“Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ;","tha-ap518:5.3":"Sukhette vappitaṃ bījaṃ, sayambhumhi aho mama [ahosi me (syā.)].","tha-ap518:6.1":"“Kusalaṃ vijjate mayhaṃ, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","tha-ap518:6.3":"Pūjāraho ahaṃ ajja, sakyaputtassa sāsane.","tha-ap518:7.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap518:8.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap518:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap518:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ajjunapupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap518:11.1":"Ajjunapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
